{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは！\nスイカを摂取したくなる最近\nてぃーちゃんだよ٩(｡•ω•｡)﻿و"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/11/4239488/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みてみて、\nこのTシャツかわいくて\nお気に入り"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/11/4239488/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これね、\n実はね\n胸元の字をよく読んでみるとわかるんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"\"Heart of Kyusyu\""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってかいてあるの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"熊本地震で被災された方や\n復興支援のためのチャリティーTシャツで、\nTシャツの収益全額、被害を受けた地域の復興に利用されるんだって。ネットで熊本地震がおきたときに何かできないかなっておもってみつけて買ってたんだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"支援にもなるし、\nロゴがオシャレだから\nふだん使いできるデザインでおすすめ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"九州愛"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/11/4239488/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく東京出身っぽいゆわれるけど、\n長崎出身なんだよ٩(｡•ω•｡)﻿و"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんま方言でらんけん\nそう思われるんかなあ、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地元帰るとめっちゃ方言٩(｡•ω•｡)﻿و"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"復興のためになにかしたいってきもちでいっぱい。。。あとね、九州で乃木坂を広めたいし、長崎や生まれの福岡で個人の仕事がしたいなあ！って気持ちは乃木坂入ってずっと目標。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長崎の某有名CMにでたい。\n長崎県の特使になりたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドォーモとか\nアサデス。とか\nあっぷるとかにでたい。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/11/4239488/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハウステンボスとかで\nイベントしたい。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/11/4239488/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっぱい目標ある\nがんばるっ٩(｡•ω•｡)﻿و"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/11/4239488/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/11/4239488/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/11/4239488/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Love in Kyusyu！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、LinQさん思い出す、、、！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいぴち☆"}],"source":"archive"}